{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062806/block/singleImage/3262063/df/01M6ZMHJGAFDWETRE0Q0P9V9TQ.jpg?updatedAt=1794211170\"/><figcaption>哥基犬蘭諾斯在比賽掙脫狗繩搶風頭。(X)</figcaption></figure><p>在周日（8日）的美國美式足球賽事中，一頭吉祥物的哥基犬成為比賽的主力。因為牠在中場時間突然走脫，在球場上突破多位追趕的保安。 這場美國國家美式足球聯盟（NFL）的比賽，由卡羅萊納黑豹對丹佛野馬，屬於黑豹隊的吉祥物哥基犬蘭諾斯（ Lennox the Corgi ）在半場的時間，掙脫狗繩走入了球場內，牠一直沿邊嘔走向底線，後面追趕的保安嘗試從後抱住，不過未能成功，蘭諾斯左閃右避後，在經過多次的攔截終於被捉住。球場也在螢光幕上指牠成為比賽最多突破攔截的選手。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062806/block/singleImage/3262085/df/01M6ZMHJFFWP6PQE4K6MB9ZJSN.jpg?updatedAt=1794211170\"/><figcaption>球場顯示蘭諾斯的突然攔截次數居首。(X)</figcaption></figure><p>This corgi might be the best athlete on the field https://t.co/H15rfk3JSB — Barstool Sports (@barstoolsports) November 8, 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.139528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":398,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:59:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:12.046435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:31.790817+00:00","content_hash":"f2a45c0524d791d194e62aecdb818da3f82ef586a9a65c8e7191d6277d9aed23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}